    <summary>
            Represents a control that the user can toggle between two states: on or off.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            A <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Switch" /> is a UI element that can be toggled between on and off states.
            Use the <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Switch.IsToggled" /> property to determine or set the current state.
            </remarks>
